.TH OPENCLASSCRAFT 6 "2026-08-17" "OpenClassCraft 0.1.0" "Games"
.SH NAME
openclasscraft \- classroom-focused voxel coding game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B openclasscraft
[\fB--server\fR \fISERVER OPTIONS\fR | \fICLIENT OPTIONS\fR]
[\fICOMMON OPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B OpenClassCraft
is an educational voxel environment in which learners arrange in-world
programming blocks to control robots.  It includes classroom lesson tools,
chemistry activities, accessibility helpers, and local multiplayer, on top of
a customized Luanti engine.
.SH COMMON OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Print supported options and exit.
.TP
.B --version
Print version and build information and exit.
.TP
.BI --config " file"
Load configuration from the given file.
.TP
.BI --logfile " file"
Write logs to the given file.  Use an empty value to disable file logging.
.TP
.B --info
Enable informational console output.
.TP
.B --verbose
Enable verbose console output.
.TP
.B --trace
Enable trace-level console output.
.TP
.B --quiet
Print only errors.
.TP
.BI --gameid " id"
Select a game, or use
.B --gameid list
to list installed games.  The bundled educational game ID is
.BR luanti_edu .
.TP
.BI --worldname " name"
Select a world by name.
.TP
.BI --world " path"
Select a world by path.
.TP
.BI --port " port"
Select the UDP network port.
.TP
.B --run-unittests
Run the inherited engine unit tests and exit.
.SH CLIENT OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --address " address"
Connect to a server address.  An empty address starts a local game.
.TP
.B --go
Skip the main menu and start directly.
.TP
.BI --name " player"
Set the player name.
.TP
.BI --password-file " file"
Read the player password from a file.
.TP
.B --random-input
Enable random input for testing.
.SH SERVER OPTIONS
.TP
.B --server
Run a server using the client executable.
.TP
.B --terminal
Display the interactive server terminal when supported.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LUANTI_GAME_PATH
Colon-delimited list of additional game directories.
.TP
.B LUANTI_MOD_PATH
Colon-delimited list of additional mod directories.
.TP
.B LUANTI_USER_PATH
User-data directory for an installed build.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I minetest.conf
Configuration file name retained for Luanti compatibility.
.SH BUGS
Report OpenClassCraft issues at
https://github.com/OpenClassCraft/OpenClassCraft/issues.
.SH COPYRIGHT
OpenClassCraft includes software derived from Luanti and Minetest Game.
See the installed README and license files for authorship, attribution, and
the licenses applying to each component.
.SH WWW
https://github.com/OpenClassCraft/OpenClassCraft
